        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p><span style=\"\">The correct mirror image of the given figure when the mirror is held on the PQ&nbsp;side.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/03/F1_SSC_Amit%20A_10-03-2023_D44.png\" style=\"width: 285px; height: 89px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><u>Detailed Explanation:</u></span></p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n\t<li style=\"\">The correct mirror image of the given figure is &quot;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/03/F1_SSC_Amit%20A_10-03-2023_D41.png\" style=\" width: 136px; height: 22px;\" />&quot; the seventh&nbsp;letter&nbsp;of the given image is <strong>&#39;I&#39;</strong> and the correct mirror image is <strong>&quot;I&quot;</strong> but it is wrongly given in options 1 &amp; 4&nbsp;so option 1 &amp; 4&nbsp;is eliminated.</li>\n\t<li>The correct mirror image of the given figure is &quot;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/03/F1_SSC_Amit%20A_10-03-2023_D41.png\" style=\" width: 136px; height: 22px;\" />&quot; the fifth&nbsp;letter&nbsp;of the given image is &#39;O&#39; and the correct mirror image is &quot;O&quot; but it is wrongly given in option 3&nbsp;so option 3&nbsp;is eliminated.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&quot;Option 2&quot;.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\"><span style=\"display: flex;gap: 6px;align-items: center;\"><img height=\"26px\" src=\"//cdn.testbook.com/resources/lms_creative_elements/additional-information-image.png\" width=\"26px\" /><strong><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;font-size: 21px;\"><u>Additional Information</u></span></strong></span>&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><span style=\"display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center;\">1) In the mirror image left side and right side changed vice-versa where the top and bottom remain the same.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\">2) In a real given mirror image the farthest number or alphabet appears closest in the mirror image.</p>\n\n<ul style=\"\">\n</ul>\n",
